+    (:func:`integrate.build_bundle_base`), and its members were what ``m`` is ordered after
+    (:func:`_closure_members`). Read from ``m``'s own record, as the cut point is
+    (``integrate._member_cut_point``), which checks that ``m``'s branch still holds it."""
